        service role arn selector
    targets : [SsmAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1MaintenanceWindowTaskSpecInitProviderTargetsItems0], default is Undefined, optional
        The targets (either instances or window target ids). Instances are specified using Key=InstanceIds,Values=instanceid1,instanceid2. Window target ids are specified using Key=WindowTargetIds,Values=window target id1, window target id2.
    taskArn : str, default is Undefined, optional
        The ARN of the task to execute.
    taskArnRef : SsmAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1MaintenanceWindowTaskSpecInitProviderTaskArnRef, default is Undefined, optional
